Subject: metal 0023: air_metal_test --draw-ca, metaltest 18/19's CA quad on the host (test only)

Replays metaltest caQuad (QuartzCore vertex_layout_info[0]: stride 48, five attributes in
buffer 1; vertices and UInt16 indices in one pool buffer at offsets 96 and 288; identity
vertex buffers, six zeroed fragment buffers; BGRA8 64x64 cleared 404040ff) in four cases:
(a) as metaltest, (b) non-indexed at offset 0, (c) indexed at offset 0, (d) vertex offset
only. Prints six probe pixels and the count of pixels that differ from the clear.
Softpipe cannot run QuartzCore's fixed_vert_*_spc or fixed_frag_lph_cph (f2f16, 8-bit
scratch in nir_to_tgsi); std_vert0_lpf over metaltest's fs_color runs. No driver change.

